## API Documentation

### Authentication Endpoints
```typescript
POST /api/auth/signin
POST /api/auth/signout
GET /api/auth/session
POST /api/auth/csrf
```

### Nutrition Tracking
```typescript
GET /api/food/search
POST /api/food/log
GET /api/food/history
PUT /api/food/:id
DELETE /api/food/:id
```

### Water Tracking
```typescript
POST /api/water/log
GET /api/water/history
GET /api/water/stats
PUT /api/water/goals
```

### Analytics
```typescript
GET /api/analytics/nutrition
GET /api/analytics/water
GET /api/analytics/trends
GET /api/analytics/export
```

### User Management
```typescript
GET /api/user/profile
PUT /api/user/profile
GET /api/user/preferences
PUT /api/user/preferences
```

### Meal Planning
```typescript
POST /api/meal-plan/generate
GET /api/meal-plan/current
PUT /api/meal-plan/:id
DELETE /api/meal-plan/:id
```

